        "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
        "explanation": "Doctor converts the abstract four-times-daily instruction into a concrete, refrigerator-ready schedule with a missing-dose rule.",
        "quote": "用药时间我帮您排好了，可以直接贴冰箱： 左氧氟沙星滴眼液（右眼）：早8点 → 午12点 → 晚6点 → 睡前10点"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00041",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly ties the prescribed frequency to the family’s stated confusion about missed doses and provides a clear, time-based schedule that prevents both under- and over-treatment.",
        "quote": "如果不确定昨天晚上有没有滴，不用额外补滴，直接按原定时间等下一次就好"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
        "explanation": "Doctor carries forward the earlier discussion about caretaker rotation and eye-drop timing into a concrete, shareable schedule that fits the stated constraints.",
        "quote": "您排的“右眼可乐必妥/左氧氟沙星，8点、12点、18点、22点，每次1滴”我已经发到家庭群了"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
        "explanation": "Doctor provides explicit, quantitative thresholds for blood pressure and glucose that differentiate routine from emergency, while also listing eye-related red flags for immediate care.",
        "quote": "收缩压（高压）超过180mmHg，或者同时伴随头晕头痛、胸闷看不清的不舒服"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
        "explanation": "Doctor acknowledges the family’s real-world monitoring constraints and simplifies the plan to a single daily measurement with a clear morning routine, reducing caregiver burden.",
        "quote": "您安排的「早上空腹测血糖+早上起床安静状态测血压」就是最实用的组合，就按这个来测、记下来，复查带给医生就够了。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
