          "explanation": "Doctor uses the family’s conflicting report about left-eye history and the discharge slip to explicitly identify that the affected eye is the recently operated right eye and that the left eye is prior artificial lens follow-up.",
          "quote": "患眼应该就是刚做的右眼。别的眼药我现在没翻到，可能就这一瓶。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did ask about both eyes and used the family’s account to form a right-eye plan, but did not actively query the workspace to reconcile the left-eye prior postoperative history or explain the timeline distinction in a way that explicitly prevents future confusion beyond the current right-eye label.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
