    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00150",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes between resolved elements (medication schedule, warning signs) and acceptable residuals (follow-up date uncertain but with a concrete verification plan) and obtains caregiver teach-back.",
          "quote": "血压血糖只要尽量坚持每天早上测一次就够了，不用因为记录不齐有压力，复查的时候把有的记录带给医生就可以。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly classified residual uncertainties as acceptable only with a concrete verification plan, identified blocking risks (eye drop laterality confusion, missed doses, red-flag symptoms without a care path), and obtained caregiver receipt through teach-back of the eye, drop, frequency, warning signs, and logging method.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00082",
          "explanation": "Doctor reconciles the family’s report of mild irritation with targeted screening for complications, and uses the improvement as a basis for home care while preserving urgent escalation thresholds.",
          "quote": "如果只是血压轻度升高到160-170mmHg，或者血糖轻度升高到10-12mmol/L，老人没有明显不舒服，就正常去门诊复查，把数值带给医生看就可以，不用提前急诊。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did not explicitly discuss the reliability of the family’s report beyond stating that the current appearance is reassuring; the plan was based mainly on the family’s subjective account without a distinct verification step or explicit uncertainty assessment.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": false
    }
  ],
